{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the most powerful weapon against an evil boss ruling over a dungeon full of monsters? An ancient sword? A magic ring? No! The most powerful spell of all: Unionization!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hoard\u2019s LLC is a cozy, story-driven puzzle game where you play as Barry, a mild-mannered minotaur working deep in the depths of a corporate dungeon. When Barry starts to realize his coworkers are being exploited, he sets out to do something truly radical: help them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a maze of departments\u2014like Loot Logistics and Monster Resources\u2014solving clever puzzles to reconnect isolated coworkers. Along the way, you'll uncover endearing stories, roll your eyes at cheesy corporate humor, and bring together a community that needs each other now more than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Help Barry navigate dungeon departments by rotating tiles to create paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/Movie_010.gif?t=1746627275\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles to get to coworkers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hear their endearing stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deal with the cheeky corporate humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unionize!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590180?t=1746627275","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590180?t=1746627275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/23fcb13db88358de1e9ae3bc199d634c6765edea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746627275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/23fcb13db88358de1e9ae3bc199d634c6765edea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746627275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the most powerful weapon against an evil boss ruling over a dungeon full of monsters? An ancient sword? A magic ring? No! The most powerful spell of all: Unionization!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hoard\u2019s LLC is a cozy, story-driven puzzle game where you play as Barry, a mild-mannered minotaur working deep in the depths of a corporate dungeon. When Barry starts to realize his coworkers are being exploited, he sets out to do something truly radical: help them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a maze of departments\u2014like Loot Logistics and Monster Resources\u2014solving clever puzzles to reconnect isolated coworkers. Along the way, you'll uncover endearing stories, roll your eyes at cheesy corporate humor, and bring together a community that needs each other now more than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Help Barry navigate dungeon departments by rotating tiles to create paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/Movie_010.gif?t=1746627275\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles to get to coworkers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hear their endearing stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deal with the cheeky corporate humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unionize!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cephalopod Ink"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/75b2c607f8ad9426ed